  "body": "Packet #1179 (`LAND-DOC-RECEIPT-THU-HOI-C1a1b`), revision 9, generation 1. Mission #499.\n\n- Spec \u0111\u00f3ng b\u0103ng: `ops/specs/wp1179-c1a1b-r9.md`, master `9607e3e`, sha256 `c9bc8aca\u2026ef74`.\n- Lease: `wp1179-r9-g1-claude-remote-20261106`, nh\u00e1nh `ops/wp1179-r9-g1-lease` @ `fc775f5`.\n- Assurance m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau: `cross_approved` tr\u00ean \u0111\u00fang head, c\u1ed9ng human audit c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 kho tr\u01b0\u1edbc merge. **Kh\u00f4ng merge, kh\u00f4ng land t\u1eeb phi\u00ean executor.**\n\n## Thay \u0111\u1ed5i (\u0111\u00fang write set, 2 t\u1ec7p)\n\n**`.claude/dev/doc_receipt_thu_hoi_git.py` (m\u1edbi)**\n- N\u1ea1p `doc_receipt_thu_hoi.py` (C1a1a) theo \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn t\u1ec7p v\u00e0 g\u1ecdi nguy\u00ean `kiem_json`. Kh\u00f4ng vi\u1ebft l\u1ea1i lu\u1eadt K n\u00e0o.\n- Ch\u1ea1y G0\u2013G9 qua m\u1ed9t reader `cat-file --batch` duy nh\u1ea5t, b\u0103m l\u1ea1i t\u1eebng object. Memo theo `(ki\u1ec3u, OID)`.\n- Ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i theo b\u1ea3ng \u0111\u00f3ng s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n `E` v\u00e0 b\u1ea3ng ph\u1ea1m vi t\u00e0i nguy\u00ean chung \u1edf \u00a72.3.\n- ABI b\u1ed1n kho\u00e1. M\u00e3 tho\u00e1t 2/12/13/0.\n- CLI `kiem-git`.\n\n**`.claude/dev/doc_receipt_thu_hoi_test.py`**\n- Th\u00eam nh\u00f3m Git: 97 ca, 81 \u0111\u1ed9t bi\u1ebfn (72 tr\u00ean module, 9 h\u1ea1 t\u1ea7ng ch\u1ea1y tr\u00ean b\u1ea3n sao suite, g\u1ed3m e2e c\u00f3 child d\u01b0\u01a1ng).\n- D\u00f2ng t\u1ed5ng c\u1ed9ng hai nh\u00f3m, gi\u1eef \u0111\u00fang regex s\u1ed5. Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea1m s\u1ed5 `ci_dang_ky_test.py` (ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u00e1n B).\n- `doc_receipt_thu_hoi.py` gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean byte (A1).\n\nK\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc theo `git diff --numstat origin/master...HEAD`: +1304 d\u00f2ng (357 + 947/\u22126). Tr\u1ea7n do ch\u1ee7 kho n\u00e2ng l\u00ean \u2264 1350, `issuecomment-6700073551`.\n\n## Ki\u1ec3m (Linux, head `2ae69b8`)\n\nSuite rc 0:\n\n| Nh\u00f3m | Ca | \u0110\u1ed9t bi\u1ebfn | equivalent_verified |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| json | 156/156 | 162/162 | 9 (b\u1eb1ng n\u1ec1n) |\n| git | 97/97 | 81/81 | 1 (t2, b\u1ecb t3/t5 che; c\u00f3 ID c\u1ea3 nh\u00f3m t2+t3+t5) |\n| t\u1ed5ng (d\u00f2ng s\u1ed5) | 253/253 | 243/243 | \u2014 |\n\nGate ph\u1ee5:\n- `ruff --select F`: delta 0 so v\u1edbi n\u1ec1n.\n- `doctrine-scan` rc 0.\n- `adr-song` rc 0.\n- `git diff --check` rc 0.\n- `ci_dang_ky_test.py` rc 0.\n\n## Ch\u01b0a xong\n\n- A16 Windows (`required`): s\u1ebd ch\u1ea1y t\u1eadp trung qua phi\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec1u ph\u1ed1i.\n- Cross-review Codex l\u01b0\u1ee3t 1/3.\n- A17 full mutant audit Ubuntu (`ci-dot-bien-du.yml`): phi\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec1u ph\u1ed1i k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t.\n- Human audit c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 kho.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrZNAaGP4K8HUy8WEp5)_",
